    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105899" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυμπᾰν-ίας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου,</span>
		
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυμπᾰν-ίης</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυμπανοειδής, ὕδρωψ</span>
			 a kind of dropsy in which the belly <i>is stretched tight
				like a drum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.424
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>one who suffers from</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυμπανίας ὕδρωψ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.8.9
			</span></i>.</div>
